From e896788ebef032d5d5ac2b4d6424f40e76357856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vince.ceccarelli@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 19:54:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): use the runner's version-matched chromedriver; Node
 22

PR #3 failed only on the axe step:

  chromedriver@152.0.2 vs Chrome 151.0.7922.173 on ubuntu-24.04
  Error: session not created: This version of ChromeDriver only
  supports Chrome version 152

npm's chromedriver package tracks Chrome stable and drifts ahead of the
runner image. GitHub-hosted images ship a ChromeDriver matched to their
own Chrome at $CHROMEWEBDRIVER; use it and pass --chromedriver-path.
The step fails loudly if no matched driver is present rather than
silently skipping accessibility testing.

Also bumps setup-node to 22: Node 20 is deprecated on Actions runners
and sits below chromedriver's engine floor (>=22), which produced the
EBADENGINE warning in the same run.

Also commits the .vercel line that 'vercel link' appended to .gitignore,
which was showing as an uncommitted change on every branch switch.

Every other CI step already passed, including 'npm run verify'
(ALL CONTRACTS HELD).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019GWsiUVmM3mLw1X2wD6eJi
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml | 16 +++++++++++++---
 .gitignore               |  1 +
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index 31bcf69..a11a673 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ jobs:
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
       - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
         with:
-          node-version: 20
+          node-version: 22
           cache: npm
 
       - run: npm ci
@@ -44,8 +44,18 @@ jobs:
       - name: Acceptance contract
         run: npm run verify
 
+      # Use the runner image's own ChromeDriver, which is version-matched to
+      # its bundled Chrome. npm's chromedriver package tracks Chrome stable and
+      # drifts ahead of the image (152 vs 151), which is what broke PR #3.
       - name: Accessibility (axe)
-        run: npx --yes @axe-core/cli@4 http://localhost:3000/ --exit
+        run: |
+          DRIVER="${CHROMEWEBDRIVER:-/usr/local/share/chromedriver-linux64}/chromedriver"
+          if [ ! -x "$DRIVER" ]; then
+            echo "::error::no version-matched chromedriver on this runner (looked in '$DRIVER')"
+            exit 1
+          fi
+          "$DRIVER" --version
+          npx --yes @axe-core/cli@4 http://localhost:3000/ --exit --chromedriver-path "$DRIVER"
 
       - name: Stop server
         if: always()
@@ -58,7 +68,7 @@ jobs:
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
       - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
         with:
-          node-version: 20
+          node-version: 22
           cache: npm
       - run: npm ci
       - run: npm run build
diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index ab150d1..a9a3014 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -9,3 +9,4 @@ out/
 
 # delivery artifacts — patches never live in the tree
 *.patch
+.vercel
-- 
